## What it does
- **Self-contained single file** — all CSS + JS inline, no fetches, works from `file://`.
- **Russian UI, inline SVG icons** (nav arrows, grip handle, trophy/check marks, type chips).
- **Step wizard** identical to the original: 8 шага (Первый…Восьмой), each with 3 cards × 4 items. Progress bar + step indicator + "Назад/Далее/Завершить".
- **Drag-and-drop ranking** — pointer-based, works with **mouse (drag anywhere on item)** and **touch (drag the ⋮⋮ handle)**. No library; reorders within each card.
- **No email step / no redirect** — finish computes the score and shows it in the same app.

## Scoring (matches the original exactly)
Per card list: position 0 («Я наиболее») = **+1** to that letter, position 3 («Я наименее») = **−1**. Summed across all 24 lists. Result shown as `D: n · I: n · S: n · C: n`, plus the dominant type (highest score, tie-break D>I>S>C) with the decoded type descriptions and a "Пройти ещё раз" reset.

